The quail is leftmost (position 1), and the crow is third from the left (position 3). Since the crow is to the right of the robin, the robin must be position 2. The hummingbird is to the right of the owl, so the owl is position 4 and the hummingbird is position 5.

Thus the second from the right is the owl.

